---
import StorefrontLayout from '../../layouts/Storefront.astro';
---
<StorefrontLayout title="Shipping Operations">
  <div class="bg-[#0b1516] min-h-screen py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tighter mb-4">Shipping Operations.</h1>
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-[#36f4a4] uppercase tracking-widest">Last Updated: October 15, 2025</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12 text-[#dae5e6]/70 font-light leading-relaxed">
        
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2">Dispatch Timelines</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">Operational efficiency is core to our model. Orders placed before 14:00 EST Monday-Friday are dispatched to our logistics carriers on the same day. Orders placed after the cutoff, or on weekends/holidays, are processed the next business operational day.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2">Transit Methods & Costs</h2>
          <div class="bg-[#131d1e] border border-[#dae5e6]/10 p-6 rounded-sm mt-6">
            <ul class="space-y-4 font-mono text-sm">
              <li class="flex justify-between border-b border-[#dae5e6]/5 pb-4">
                <span class="text-white">Priority Insured (2-4 Days)</span>
                <span class="text-[#dae5e6]/50">Calculated at Checkout</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex justify-between pt-2">
                <span class="text-white flex items-center gap-2">Standard (5-7 Days) <span class="bg-[#36f4a4]/10 text-[#36f4a4] px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px]">Over $150</span></span>
                <span class="text-[#36f4a4] font-bold uppercase">Free</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-4 border-b border-[#dae5e6]/10 pb-2">High-Value Order Verification</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">Due to the high-value nature of electronics, orders exceeding $1,000 USD may require secondary identity verification and a mandatory signature upon delivery. We will not instruct carriers to leave high-value inventory unattended on porches under any circumstances.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</StorefrontLayout>
